The patch replaces the conditional wait with `folio_wait_writeback(folio)`, which ensures that the function waits for the writeback to complete regardless of the stable write requirement of the backing device. This prevents the log writer thread from attempting to lock a folio that is still being written back, thus eliminating the potential for deadlock.

